&_nc_oc=AdoRAv7JHA8Nvy1JvVLK5gbA5P98QooV1I7Ef7n8lXqvVcT3Cz4zl9LvK7jpakY0v7E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIojfVRw-tYcp61UZlydht3b8W_NkLXTVdRsZ0uSkeb6g&oe=6A9ED53E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1bDwwQkwqMcQ7kNvwFjF3GR&_nc_oc=AdqGK-yBoa_TNvX0gZt3g5-VePK2xobQPFLY3xsqVpxToMd5_vPAFPleLq2GUuF2t3M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJSL19GUbdrR24W_6TLbWioydS-uS7mPv9_BFitOvPmAg&oe=6A9EE63C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cIpe9Xo_dz0Q7kNvwFzLU7f&_nc_oc=Adqp3fqA3cKIpNmecoOoUSxpH8J428ZFe_C0iR8hYU1WflqIHwLmot_rTFxkhGGlrFY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLGQvZl5jNM7UkD7pWwIxUhKLaFWhf6mF6DSO0VTnjovg&oe=6A9ECC87"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Rf_UZ6HJwWwQ7kNvwGhNays&_nc_oc=AdrWbV_SXwHCuxOK1c4-ijM4v1hs5ABMiyWeZGfNPq41lhB-KxLah3xiSLmRqPlkPIw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIO_V5c843PiIT08ZoHTnqq4d8Pe7aGcDgTc-17SUDA9A&oe=6A9EB855"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OrIzh-k0bj0Q7kNvwE4-vOR&_nc_oc=AdrcSzE7_HhGMnWUz5WYQCwRmcv6Mmu7HM6K_J4enQX6S7BgMOzqbPhjZ0njsOo0Vhw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLNsW9Px0CUm238Kn6_heMGJ_kQ1RYpd7_Ze20IY59Nhg&oe=6A9EC4E4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.